	(text "RM3100-CB recreation - SPI mode (PNI Doc 1017252, Fig. 4-1 / Table 3-1 / Table 4-1)\n- I2CEN (22) tied low = SPI. SPI mode 0 or 3, MSB first, SCLK <= 1 MHz. SSN low for whole transfer.\n- RBias 121R x6: each axis xDRVP-R-xINP-coil-xINN-R-xDRVN. REXT 33k to GND. Verified vs Fig. 4-1.\n- RES pins (2, 20) to GND. NC (21, 24) unconnected. MagI2C exposed pad: DO NOT SOLDER (footprint has no EP land).\n- Sen-Z-f polarity critical: pad 2 (polarity mark) on ZDRVN side; flipping to bottom side swaps pads.\n- AVDD/DVDD within 0.1 V, single 3V3 rail (2.0-3.6 V). Ceramic caps only (no tantalum), keep far from coils.\n- Coils close together, each coil's two traces paired, MagI2C within 10 cm of coils.\n- X/Y/Z coil placement + Sen-Z-f polarity per PNI Fig. 4-4 (NED). J1: see connector note."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4bb216e4-52ee-4f31-b88c-a50cd3b99dba")
	)
