	(text "J1 HOST CONNECTOR - kept generic, part TBD\nRecommended flight: Harwin Gecko 1.25 mm, latching, 2x5 (10-pos)\nRecommended dev/EM: JST GH 1.25 mm, latching (Pixhawk-style cables)\nPlanned 10-pin, GND interleaved: 3V3, GND, SCLK, GND, MOSI,\n   MISO, GND, ~CS, DRDY, GND\nVerify connector magnetic signature near coils before flight."
